        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Swire\"]They've known each other for so long now. Who cares whether she wins or loses a competition like this?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Swire",
        "content": "They've known each other for so long now. Who cares whether she wins or loses a competition like this?"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Swire\"]Losing doesn't just mean something's up, and winning isn't gonna prove anything.",
